ape, providing targeted watering and reduced water waste.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/irrigation-8/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-08.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Residential irrigation system contractors installing efficient sprinklers for front yard lawns across North and South Florida homes.\"><img src=\"/images/images/irrigation-8/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-08.jpg\" alt=\"Residential irrigation system contractors installing efficient sprinklers for front yard lawns across North and South Florida homes.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/irrigation-2/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-02.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Residential irrigation system installation along walkways and lawn areas in South Florida, ensuring even coverage and efficient water use.\"><img src=\"/images/images/irrigation-2/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-02.jpg\" alt=\"Residential irrigation system installation along walkways and lawn areas in South Florida, ensuring even coverage and efficient water use.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/irrigation-7/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-07.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Automated lawn irrigation system installed in a modern residential home, improving water efficiency and landscape maintenance in Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/irrigation-7/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-07.jpg\" alt=\"Automated lawn irrigation system installed in a modern residential home, improving water efficiency and landscape maintenance in Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/irrigation-6/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-06.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom irrigation installation for landscaped hedges and gardens in North Florida, ensuring precise moisture control and plant health.\"><img src=\"/images/images/irrigation-6/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-06.jpg\" alt=\"Custom irrigation installation for landscaped hedges and gardens in North Florida, ensuring precise moisture control and plant health.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/irrigation-5/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-05.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Landscape irrigation system designed for residential properties in South Florida, maintaining healthy grass with optimized watering schedules.\"><img src=\"/images/images/irrigation-5/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-05.jpg\" alt=\"Landscape irrigation system designed for residential properties in South Florida, maintaining healthy grass with optimized watering schedules.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><div class=\"mm-mosaico-resto\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/irrigation-4/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-04.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Professional irrigation system installation for residential lawns in Florida, delivering uniform spray patterns and water-efficient performance.\"><img src=\"/images/images/irrigation-4/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-04.jpg\" alt=\"Professional irrigation system installation for residential lawns in Florida, delivering uniform spray patterns and water-efficient performance.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/irrigation-3/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-03.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Smart irrigation sprinkler system installed in modern residential property, designed for efficient lawn watering across North and South Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/irrigation-3/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-03.jpg\" alt=\"Smart irrigation sprinkler system installed in modern residential property, designed for efficient lawn watering across North and South Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/irrigation-1/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-01.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Automated irrigation system installed on commercial golf course landscape in North Florida, providing precise watering and healthy turf management.\"><img src=\"/images/images/irrigation-1/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-01.jpg\" alt=\"Automated irrigation system installed on commercial golf course landscape in North Florida, providing precise watering and healthy turf management.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc mm-proc--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Smart Irrigation <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our irrigation contractors design, install, and optimize smart systems using local weather data for efficient watering in North &amp; South Florida.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><ol class=\"mm-pasos\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Irrigation Assessment &amp; System Design</h3><p>Complete property analysis for irrigation needs including plant water requirements, soil type, sun exposure, and existing water features. Irrigreen smart system design with evapotranspiration sensors.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Smart System Configuration &amp; Zoning</h3><p>Design of irrigation zones optimized for plant types and soil conditions. Irrigreen app integration for remote monitoring, scheduling flexibility, and water conservation optimization.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Installation &amp; Permit Compliance</h3><p>Installation of main lines, zone valves, controller installation, and Irrigreen sensor placement. Verification of water service adequacy and any required utility permits.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">System Activation &amp; Smart Integration</h3><p>Commissioning of all zones with flow testing and pressure verification. Integration with smart home systems, user training on app functionality, and optimization for seasonal adjustments.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"mm-que\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Smart Irrigation System Installation Services in Florida</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We install smart irrigation systems in North &amp; South Florida, optimizing water usage with automated schedules tailored to your landscape.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Controllers, Sensors &amp; Scheduling</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We install Wi-Fi controllers that pull local weather data and skip a cycle when a storm moves through. Florida law requires a working rain shutoff device, so we wire rain and soil-moisture sensors into the valve circuit and set run times that match your water management district's watering days.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Smart Irrigation Controller Installation</dt><dd>South Florida installers fit smart controllers that cut water use by 20‑40% with weather‑based adjustments</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Weather‑Sensing Irrigation Upgrades</dt><dd>Contractors retrofit systems with soil moisture sensors and rain sensors to optimize watering</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo mm-grupo--activo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Sprinklers &amp; Drip Lines</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Pipe, heads, and zone count follow the pressure and flow at your point of connection, where a backflow preventer protects the potable line. Rotors and spray heads overlap head to head instead of leaving dry rings, and drip tubing runs under mulch to feed beds, hedges, and palms at the root.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Sprinkler System Installation &amp; Repair</dt><dd>Contractors design, install, and repair in‑ground sprinkler systems to prevent overwatering and dry spots</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Drip Irrigation System Installers</dt><dd>Installers design drip systems that deliver water directly to roots, saving up to 90% efficiency</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Zoning, Rerouting &amp; Redesign</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">St. Augustine turf, tropical beds, and potted color each drink differently, so each one gets its own valve, heads, and run time instead of a single blanket schedule. When a new pool deck or paver patio cuts a lateral, we reroute the line, cap orphaned heads, and rebalance the zone.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Landscape Zoning &amp; Redesign</dt><dd>Designers create irrigation zones based on plant water needs to improve efficiency and growth</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Irrigation Rerouting for Pools &amp; Hardscapes</dt><dd>North Florida experts reroute irrigation lines around new pools or hardscapes to maintain even coverage</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Leak Repair &amp; Seasonal Service</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Salt air and UV crack fittings, roots tilt heads, and a buried break shows up as a soft spot in the lawn or a spike on the meter. We pressure-test zone by zone, rebuild valves with new diaphragms and solenoids, and reset schedules for the dry season and the summer rains.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Leak Detection &amp; System Repair</dt><dd>Professionals inspect for leaks, clogs, and misaligned heads to prevent waste and costly repairs</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Seasonal Maintenance &amp; Optimization</dt><dd>Contractors perform seasonal inspections, adjust schedules, and maintain irrigation systems for Florida homeowners</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos mm-datos--tel\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-que-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/images/irrigation-9/automated-irrigation-system-installers-florida-09.jpg\" alt=\"Close view of a sprinkler head spraying beside a hedge\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"02 / 04\" data-t=\"Sprinklers &amp; Drip Lines\"></div></figure></div></section>";
const T4 = "<section class=\"mm-faq mm-faq--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Smart Irrigation <span class=\"mm-rot\">FAQs</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Have questions about smart irrigation system installation in North or South Florida? Our certified Irrigreen specialists answer the top questions here.</p></div></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How do smart irrigation controllers work in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Smart controllers use evapotranspiration sensors and local weather data to automatically adjust irrigation schedules for precise, efficient watering in Florida landscapes. As a certified Irrigreen dealer, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living installs systems that respond to real-time conditions — reducing overwatering and delivering measurable water savings.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>What are the benefits of drip irrigation systems?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Drip irrigation delivers water directly to plant roots, dramatically reducing evaporation, weed growth, and fungal disease in Florida landscapes. This targeted approach uses significantly less water than traditional sprinkler systems — making it ideal for South Florida homeowners navigating local water restrictions and rising utility costs.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can smart irrigation reduce my water bill in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Smart irrigation systems with evapotranspiration sensors prevent overwatering by adjusting schedules based on real-time weather and soil conditions. Florida homeowners who upgrade from traditional timer-based systems consistently report significant monthly water savings, with many reducing irrigation usage by 30% or more.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can irrigation zones be customized for my property?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Smart irrigation systems include individual zones designed around your property's specific plant types, soil conditions, and sun exposure. Zones can be adjusted seasonally as your landscape evolves. Our certified irrigation contractors program and test every zone before handover to ensure optimal performance across your Florida property.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Do you offer maintenance services after installation?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>We offer seasonal maintenance, system repairs, controller programming updates, and technology upgrades to keep your smart irrigation system running at peak efficiency across North and South Florida. Our certified team responds quickly to service requests, ensuring your landscape stays healthy without wasted water or unexpected failures.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado\"><div class=\"mm-faq-accion\"><a class=\"mm-btn\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><div class=\"mm-datos mm-datos--tel\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-zonas\"><div class=\"mm-zonas-caja\"><div class=\"mm-zonas-txt\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><h2 class=\"mm-etiqueta\">Where We Serve</h2><p class=\"mm-h2\">Regional <span class=\"mm-rot\">Coverage</span> With National Vision</p></div><div class=\"mm-zonas-lista\"><article class=\"mm-zona\"><h3 class=\"mm-zona-t\">North Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in North Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered for structural integrity and long-term durability.</p><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a></div><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/where-we-serve/north-florida\">View North Florida Service Areas<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></article><article class=\"mm-zona\"><h3 class=\"mm-zona-t\">South Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in South Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered, permitted, and built for high-end residential properties.</p><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span 